Third-party notices
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Simple Icons — brand mark path data (CC0 1.0)
    The LinkedIn and GitHub marks in templates/lib.typ are inlined SVG path
    data from the Simple Icons project.
    Licence: CC0 1.0 Universal (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/)
      — no attribution required; credited here anyway.
    Source: https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons
    The LinkedIn path is from tag 13.19.0: LinkedIn's mark was withdrawn from
    Simple Icons afterwards under LinkedIn's own brand-guideline enforcement,
    not a licence change — the path used here is the last one the project
    published under CC0.
    Only the path data is used; no font file, CSS or JavaScript is
    redistributed here.

Tabler Icons — generic mark path data (MIT)
    The email, phone, pin and website marks in templates/lib.typ are inlined
    SVG path data from the Tabler Icons "filled" set.
    Licence: MIT — Copyright (c) 2020-2026 Paweł Kuna
    Source: https://github.com/tabler/tabler-icons
    Only the path data is used; no font file, CSS or JavaScript is
    redistributed here.

Typefaces
    No font binaries are distributed with this skill. The font pools in
    scripts/pick_design.py name faces that are either packaged by common Linux
    distributions or available from Google Fonts under the SIL Open Font
    License 1.1. See references/fonts.md for provenance, licences and
    installation. Each face remains under its own licence.
